{"title":"The Public Choice Outreach Conference!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/953369159/0/marginalrevolution~The-Public-Choice-Outreach-Conference.html","date":1775474331000,"content":"<p>The annual Public Choice Outreach Conference is a crash course in public choice. The conference is designed for undergraduates and graduates in a wide variety of fields. It’s entirely free. Indeed scholarships are available! The conference will be held Friday June12- Sunday June 14 , near Washington, DC in Reston, VA. Lots of great speakers including Tyler, myself, Bryan Caplan, Robin Hanson, Jon Klick, Shruti Rajagopalan and more.</p>\r\n<p>Please apply and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://publicchoice.gmu.edu/center-programs/outreach2026\">encourage your students to apply</a>.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-791x1024.png\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-791x1024.png 791w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-232x300.png 232w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-768x995.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-1186x1536.png 1186w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1-1581x2048.png 1581w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-Outreach-Flyer-1.png 1700w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/the-public-choice-outreach-conference-8.html\">The Public Choice Outreach Conference!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://fe